    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm prepping a demo for my chemistry class about why cutting onions causes that stinging sensation in your eyes. Could you walk me through the specific chemical pathway and the enzymatic reaction that leads to the formation of the volatile compounds responsible for the irritation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
