      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Since I'm presenting this to students, I'd like to emphasize the \"suddenness\" of it—how it feels like a sudden, almost mischievous attack on the eyes before they even realize they've started chopping. Can you describe the speed of that reaction and why it feels so unpredictable or \"sneaky\" when it hits?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
