      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good analogy for the lag. I'm trying to help the students understand why it's so difficult to manage—why it feels less like a predictable chemical reaction and more like something is actively causing a bit of trouble in the kitchen. Is there any chemical property that makes the onset of the irritation particularly difficult to anticipate or regulate?",
